  "title": "Everyday Electric Confidence Returns for 2027 with Toyota bZ",
  "summary": "PLANO, Texas (Aug. 4, 2026) – Smooth driving, electric exhilaration, and SUV practicality enhance every drive in the 2027 Toyota bZ battery electric vehicle (BEV). Returning for its fifth year in the lineup, the 2027 bZ remains unchanged from the prior model year. It is available in XLE and Limited grades in a choice of Front- or All-Wheel Drive (FWD or AWD).",
